      "Cartons cost more per serving than a powder",
      "Protein source differs between versions (milk-based vs plant-based), so read the carton"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The most convenient kid shake when you need something portable and modest in protein.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "8 g per 8.25 fl oz carton (label)",
      "Calories": "About 180",
      "Third-party testing": "USDA Organic; no sport certification",
