      "Protein per serving": "About 25 g per full serving (label)",
      "Calories": "About 120 per full serving",
      "Third-party testing": "Brand-commissioned testing; no sport certification found",
      "Best for": "Mixing small amounts into food"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "klean-athlete-klean-isolate",
    "name": "Klean Athlete Klean Isolate",
    "brand": "Klean Athlete",
    "badge": "Best Tested Unflavored Isolate",
    "category": "Whey protein isolate",
    "description": "Klean Isolate appears in the NSF Certified for Sport registry, in unflavored, chocolate, vanilla and strawberry versions when we checked on November 8, 2026. The unflavored version is whey isolate and sunflower lecithin with no sweetener, at about 20 g of protein per scoop, per the label at the time of writing. That makes it the cleanest-tested option for an older child or young teen athlete whose doctor is fine with a supplement, used as a half scoop in food or milk.",
    "pros": [
      "NSF Certified for Sport, confirmed in the registry",
      "Unflavored version has no sweetener",
