      "Premium price per gram",
      "Unflavored isolate tastes of very little, which some kids reject in plain water",
      "Still sized for adults: a full scoop is a whole meal's protein for a 10-year-old"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "If you want the strictest testing in a plain powder, this is it; just use less.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "About 20 g per scoop (label)",
