      "NSF Certified for Sport, including unflavored (registry)",
      "Smaller dose per scoop than most adult wheys",
      "Grass-fed whey isolate with a short label",
      "Direct Amazon listing"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Premium price per gram",
      "Smaller tubs run out quickly",
      "Contains milk; not for dairy-allergic children"
