          </h2>

          <div class="faq-list">
            <details class="faq-item">
              <summary><h3>Can kids drink protein shakes?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  Yes, in the right circumstances. Kid-specific nutrition shakes such as PediaSure are designed for children and are commonly recommended by pediatricians for picky eaters or children with growth concerns. Most healthy kids do not need them. Adult protein shakes are not dangerous in small amounts, but they are dosed for adults, so check with your pediatrician first.
                </p>
